title the sixth pass: fifty twins, the teaching family whole
prompt kg on the cubist sweep -- pass six takes the teaching family entire.
think The nine teaching pages and the lunar neighbor-yogas took their twins in one pass: the navamsha trio, the true sign, the two faces of a sign, reading a planet in a house, the four directions and aims, the two ways of reading the Veda, and the neighbor yogas paired across two rooms. The aether row carried four of the ten -- the teachings that teach turned out to be the teachings that hear -- and seven distinct pairs were worn.
obs QA cards: 88 94 92 92 91 92 95 93 90 92 -- six straight passes with every page B or better and no molt frame ever pushed; fifty twins stand, the canvas past half the classical room.
obs Eleven pages remain -- the hybrid lunar day, the last themes and synthesis pages, the political-spectrum teachings, the transit, and the fund constellation page -- one final pass closes the room.
